        authority: pick("论文实验部分已经够用；下一步只需要作者确认责任、账号、截止日期等投稿事项并上传 OpenReview。这个“论文准备完成”的状态不会让其他新研究问题自动获得方法开发、P0 或 GPU 实验资格。", "The paper has enough experimental evidence for the current scope. The remaining work is human responsibility/account/deadline verification and OpenReview upload. This paper-ready status does not grant method, P0, or GPU permission to other new ideas.")
